      "headline": "The song appears on the album \"Know-It-All\" (2015)",
      "supportingCopy": "The song appears on the album \"Know-It-All\" (2015). \"Here\" is the debut single by Canadian singer-songwriter Alessia Cara, released on April 30, 2015 as lead single from her debut extended play (EP) Four Pink Walls (2015) and her debut studio album Know-It-All (2015), through Def Jam Recordings. The song was created around a sample of \"Ike's Rap II\" by Isaac Hayes from his album Black Moses (1971), \"Here\" is a pop and R&B record with soul elements, and is lyrically about people who secretly hate parties. Know-It-All is the debut studio album by Canadian/Italian singer-songwriter Alessia Cara. The album followed the release of her debut extended play (EP) Four Pink Walls (2015), which Cara regarded as a preview of the album. Artist: Alessia Cara · Title: Here · Album: Here · Year: 2016 · Genre: Hip Hop · Path: MEDIA/VIDEO/2010's/Alessia Cara -",
